{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34336","headline":"谨和谏议罢郡叙怀六韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"谨和谏议罢郡叙怀六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已报东吴政，初捐左契归。\n天应酬苦节，人不犯寒威。\n江上思重借，朝端望载饥。\n紫泥封夜诏，金殿赐春衣。\n对酒情何远，裁诗思极微。\n待升熔造日，江海问渔扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}